_name = "Cryo-Expert"
long_description = "Requirement: Ability to deal Freeze damage or use Ice magic\\\\n\\\\nCreatures affected by your Ice or Freeze effects are easier to keep controlled. The first time each round you inflict Freeze, the target also loses 1 AP."
